    {
      "text": "Solitaire just means alone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "compare",
        "before": "matthew-rose-input.webp",
        "after": "matthew-rose-render.webp",
        "beforeLabel": "3D file",
        "afterLabel": "Render"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A solitaire is a single gem set alone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-rose-render.webp",
        "label": "A solitaire",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.45,
          "y": 0.3,
          "k": 1.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The word comes from French, and from the Latin for alone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Solus",
        "sub": "Latin for alone"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Four or six prongs can hold the stone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-rose-render.webp",
        "label": "Prongs",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.45,
          "y": 0.2,
          "k": 2.2
        },
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.65,
            "y": 0.16,
            "text": "Prong",
            "at": 0.4
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A bezel can hold one too.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "A bezel",
        "sub": "Can hold a solitaire too"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Prongs lift the stone to show its size and let in light.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-front-white-render.webp",
        "label": "A lifted stone",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.26,
          "k": 2.2
        },
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.5,
            "y": 0.33,
            "text": "Light",
            "at": 0.4
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "With nothing else on the ring, the stone gets all the attention.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "render-matthew-yellow.webp",
        "label": "One stone",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.55,
          "y": 0.2,
          "k": 1.7
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Its band can be plain, or arched like a cathedral.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "The band",
        "sub": "Plain or cathedral"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nearly any wedding band style can sit beside it.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "A wedding band",
        "sub": "Nearly any style fits"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A high setting can catch on clothing.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Can snag",
        "sub": "A high setting"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So the name fits, one stone set alone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-rose-render.webp",
        "label": "One stone, set alone",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.45,
          "y": 0.3,
          "k": 1.1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A render shows a client the gold before anything is cast.",
